  "title": "8 iPhone productivity hacks for your NYC subway ride",
  "caption": "NYC, you've been using your iPhone wrong 😳\nSwipe through before your stop.\n\nMore things your iPhone can do:\n• Lock any app with Face ID by holding its icon\n• Swipe down on the Home Screen to search anything\n• Recover deleted photos from Recently Deleted\n• Download offline maps before a trip\n• Swipe on the Calculator display to delete the last digit\n\nDownload Cardivo:\n1. Open the App Store\n2. Type \"Cardivo\" in the search bar\n3. Tap Get and open the app\n\n#iphonetips #learnontiktok #iphonetipsandtricks #nyctiktok #cardivo #iphonehacks #brooklyn #newyork #iphonetricks",
